    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: a40088d13f3f54e9f42f9736bfd7781b64331078 -->\n**Clean - delta review of the line-ending fix.** No new build; see the checks.\n\n- The behaviour review of head a163d62e3 stands (NeoTech, 17:49Z, one blocker: CRLF line endings; all suites and clippy green there).\n- `git diff -w --ignore-cr-at-eol a163d62e3 a40088d13` is empty. The raw delta is 1559/1559 symmetric changes in six files: line endings only.\n- The PR diff against main is 16 files, +824/-29, with 0 CR bytes. That is the same content as the reviewed head.\n- The two notes from the first review stay open for follow-up work, not for this PR: the cached-warning block after a turn to a clear position, and the long refusal text for huge angles.\n\nThe PR is merge-ready. A maintainer merges by hand.\n",
