    "body": "This PR was in the merge batch of 2026-11-16, but it was not merged. It conflicts with main in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`. The label `merge-ready` changed to `conflicts`, and the PR is a draft again.\n\nThe conflict is in the tool list of `fn all()`:\n\n```diff\n++<<<<<<< HEAD\n +        .chain(super::fixture_turn_tools::TOOLS)\n++=======\n+         .chain(super::fixture_profile_tools::TOOLS)\n++>>>>>>> origin/main\n```\n\nEach side added one line. The probable resolution keeps the two lines. This is a hand edit, so `cargo xtask merge-plan --delta` classes the refresh as DELTA. The refresh then needs a delta review of the remerge-diff before the merge. I did not push a refresh.\n",
