    "body": "Merged `origin/main` into the branch to remove the conflict. New head: `f519b9299f5c7b0d991e994567e7505b5c380248`.\n\nResolved hunk (one):\n\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, `fn all()`: main adds `.chain(super::fixture_profile_tools::TOOLS)`. The branch adds `.chain(super::fixture_turn_tools::TOOLS)`. The merge keeps the two lines.\n\nAll other files merged without a conflict. `git diff origin/main` shows only the files of this PR. No CR bytes in the files of this PR.\n\nInteraction with main's fixture profiles (#2101) and lathe chucks (#2083): the collision box and mesh of a fixture come from `model::entity_world_aabb` and `model::world_facets`. These read the posed entity. `TurnFixture` writes the pose through `MoveFixture`. `SetFixtureProfile` replaces the local facets only and keeps the pose. Thus the collision shape of a turned profile fixture or chuck is the turned shape.\n\nTests run on the new head (debug):\n\n- `camcraft-app`: `fixture_turn` 5/5, `mcp_fixture_turn` 1/1, `mcp` 22/22, `fixture_profiles` 5/5, `fixture_profile_collision` 6/6, `mcp_fixture_profile` 2/2, `lathe_chuck` 6/6.\n- `camcraft-ui` lib (`fixture_rows`, `fixtures_page`, `fixture_profile` filters): 21/21. `camcraft-ui --test fixtures`: 7/7.\n- Clippy `-D warnings`: `camcraft-ui --all-targets` is clean. `camcraft-app` lib, bins and the integration tests of this PR are clean. Two test targets of main do not compile (`posting_section_mode.rs` lib test, `tests/section_mode.rs`). This is a defect on main, not in this PR. Issue #2272 tracks it.\n\n`cargo xtask merge-plan --delta 2187 --reviewed a40088d13`: DELTA (hand-resolved `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`).\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
