    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: f519b9299f5c7b0d991e994567e7505b5c380248 -->\n**Verdict: clean. Delta review of the merge of main only (no build at this head; the full review at head a40088d13 stands).**\n\nWhat was checked:\n- a40088d13 is an ancestor of f519b9299. The merge has two parents: a40088d13 and main 768834bc7.\n- The remerge-diff holds one hand hunk: `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, `fn all()`. Both sides are kept: `.chain(super::fixture_turn_tools::TOOLS)` and `.chain(super::fixture_profile_tools::TOOLS)`.\n- The PR diff against current main has the same shape as the reviewed head: 16 files, +824, -29. Line endings: no CR bytes. No content change since a40088d13 beyond the merge.\n- GitHub reports MERGEABLE against 4e0b9abef.\n\nThe PR is a draft. The maintainer or the merging session flags it ready at the merge.\n",
